<title>USA: Datapoint OKs swap of pfd shrs.</title>
<headline>Datapoint OKs swap of pfd shrs.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Datapoint Corp said Tuesday it agreed to accept 1,148,061 shares of its $1.00 exchangeable preferred stock, liquidation preference $20 per share, tendered in its exchange offer.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the exchange offer, each share of $1.00 preferred stock tendered would be exchanged for 3.25 share of common stock, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
